    "title": "RR vs CSK, IPL 2026: Head-to-head record, most runs, wickets ahead of Rajasthan Royals vs Chennai Super Kings",
    "text": "Here is a comprehensive breakdown of all the statistics you need to know ahead of the IPL 2026 match between Rajasthan Royals and Chennai Super Kings on March 30.Updated : Mar 30, 2026 19:26 IST , Chennai - 1 MIN READ Team SportstarRavindra Jadeja is the leading wicket-taker in matches between Chennai Super Kings and Rajasthan Royals | Photo Credit: PTI Ravindra Jadeja is the leading wicket-taker in matches between Chennai Super Kings and Rajasthan Royals | Photo Credit: PTI Sanju Samson will make his much-awaited debut in yellow when Chennai Super Kings takes on Rajasthan Royals at the ACA-Barsapara Stadium in Guwahati on March 30.Follow live updates from the match here.RR and CSK met twice last season, with the Jaipur-based franchise coming out on top in both meetings. Nitish Rana’s rapid 81 and Wanindu Hasaranga’s four-wicket haul led it to victory in the first meeting in Guwahati, while Akash Madhwal’s dismantling of the CSK top-order led the Royals to victory in Chennai.Ahead of the Rajasthan Royals vs Chennai Super Kings IPL 2026 match, here are some important statistics to know: RR vs CSK head-to-head record: Matches played: 31 Rajasthan Royals wins: 15 Chennai Super Kings wins: 16 MOST RUNS IN RR vs CSK IPL MATCHES Player Runs Average Strike-rate HS Shane Watson 679 39.94 153.61 106 Suresh Raina 630 27.39 134.61 98 MS Dhoni 585 39.00 128.57 75* Jos Buttler 367 45.87 139.01 95* Ravindra Jadeja 320 40.00 130.08 37MOST WICKETS IN RR VS CSK IPL MATCH Player Wickets Average Economy rate BBI Ravindra Jadeja 21 23.38 7.32 4/11 R. Ashwin 19 22.73 8.17 2/20 Albie Morkel 14 20.07 8.26 2/21 Dwayne Bravo 13 27.46 9.87 2/16 Sohail Tanvir 10 8.70 7.25 6/14 Comments Published on Mar 30, 2026 Related Topics IPL 2026 / Rajasthan Royals / Chennai Super Kings / Shane Watson / Ravindra Jadeja Latest on Sportstar Live Blog - 2 days agoFIDE Chess Candidates 2026 LIVE, Round 2: R Praggnanandhaa, Wei Yi play out draw; R Vaishali share points with Divya Deshmukh Team Sp